    "KEY": "ACHIEVEMENT_DESC_far_from_home_achievement",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/dlc/fp1/dlc_fp1_achievements_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Starting and staying as a $north_germanic_group$ $norse_pagan_adherent$ of any kind, have your [realm_capital|E] on any of the [GetGeographicalRegion('dlc_fp1_achievement_far_from_home').GetName] [region|E]. $rd_character_blocked_from_achievement$",
    "RUS": "Начните игру как $north_germanic_group_collective_noun$ий $norse_pagan_adherent$ и перенесите [Concept( 'realm_capital', 'столицу державы' )|E] в [Concept( 'region', 'регион' )|E] [GetGeographicalRegion('dlc_fp1_achievement_far_from_home').GetName]. $rd_character_blocked_from_achievement$",
    "POL": "Rozpoczynając i pozostając jako dowolny północnogermański $norse_pagan_adherent$, posiadaj [Concept( 'realm_capital', 'stolicę państwa' )|E] w [Concept( 'region', 'regionie' )|E] [GetGeographicalRegion('dlc_fp1_achievement_far_from_home').GetName]. $rd_character_blocked_from_achievement$",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "ACHIEVEMENT_DESC_miklagardariki_achievement",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/dlc/fp1/dlc_fp1_achievements_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Starting and staying as a $north_germanic_group$ $norse_pagan_adherent$ of any kind, [completely_control|E] the [kingdom|E] of $k_thessalonika$ & hold any [empire|E] without holding $e_byzantium$. $rd_character_blocked_from_achievement$",
    "RUS": "Начните игру как $north_germanic_group_collective_noun$ий $norse_pagan_adherent$, [Concept( 'completely_control', 'полностью контролируете' )|E] [kingdom|El] $k_thessalonika$ и владеете любой [Concept( 'empire', 'империей' )|E], за исключением титула $e_byzantium$. $rd_character_blocked_from_achievement$",
    "POL": "Rozpoczynając i pozostając jako dowolny północnogermański $norse_pagan_adherent$, w [Concept( 'completely_control', 'pełni kontroluj' )|E] [kingdom|E] Saloników i posiadaj dowolne [empire|El] bez posiadania tytułu Cesarstwa Bizantyńskiego. $rd_character_blocked_from_achievement$",
    "BEL": ""
  },
